  "body": "section of autocomplete attribute in W3C HTML5.3\r\nhttp://w3c.github.io/html/sec-forms.html#autofilling-form-controls-the-autocomplete-attribute\r\n> Warning! When fields with the autocomplete attribute are hidden off-screen or visually disguised, there is a risk that personal data is entered or changed using the autofill feature of browsers and password managers, without the user being aware.\r\n> User agents should verify that all fields with the autocomplete attribute are visible within the viewport before automatically entering data.\r\n\r\n　\r\n\r\nThe above should be added to section of autocomplete attribute in HTML Living Standard too.\r\nBecause the above is important security issues.",
